/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (Seeds are compiled to unoptimized IR. The mutator changes one guard comparison at a time and throws out any mutant that introduces UB. Each program runs through six pipelines, including an sroa-only control. We flag a candidate if a guard disappears or the optimized build behaves differently from -O0 on any input. Alive2, a translation validator built on the Z3 solver, then decides whether the change is a legal UB-based removal or a real miscompile.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [13]
>>
